WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.126
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:11.127 --> 00:00:14.350
I'm a koala.

3
00:00:14.351 --> 00:00:19.147
Koalas are marsupials.

4
00:00:19.148 --> 00:00:24.925
Female marsupials carry their babies in pouches.

5
00:00:24.926 --> 00:00:27.879
Where do you live?

6
00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.384
Koalas live in Australia.

7
00:00:31.385 --> 00:00:34.743
We like forests.

8
00:00:34.744 --> 00:00:38.209
We like to be in trees.

9
00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:41.414
Are you a good climber?

10
00:00:41.415 --> 00:00:50.075
Koalas are great climbers.

11
00:00:50.076 --> 00:00:56.076
We use our feet to grab branches.

12
00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:58.933
Is that your tree?

13
00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:04.374
Yes. Each koala has its own trees.

14
00:01:04.375 --> 00:01:13.656
We mark our trees with scratches.

15
00:01:13.657 --> 00:01:19.309
Male koalas mark their trees with their scent.

16
00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.595
Where do you sleep?

17
00:01:22.596 --> 00:01:26.507
Koalas sleep up in the trees.

18
00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:31.118
We sleep for most of the day!

19
00:01:31.119 --> 00:01:34.495
What do you eat?

20
00:01:34.496 --> 00:01:39.888
Koalas eat leaves from one kind of tree.

21
00:01:39.889 --> 00:01:43.633
We have pouches in our cheeks.

22
00:01:43.634 --> 00:01:47.923
We store extra leaves in them.

23
00:01:47.924 --> 00:01:51.287
Who are your enemies?

24
00:01:51.288 --> 00:01:55.998
We're usually safe in our trees.

25
00:01:55.999 --> 00:02:08.089
But wild dogs and owls sometimes eat koalas.

26
00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:13.120
I'm tired from eating so many leaves!

27
00:02:13.121 --> 00:02:19.888
I'm going to sleep now.

28
00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:26.487
Good-bye, Koala!

